The vertex shader of dEQP-GLES2.functional.shaders.operator.binary_operator.add.highp_float_vec2_vertex as dEQP-GLES2 writes it (verbatim: tools/mali/testdata/deqp_shapes/colourpair_constant_then_varying.vert), with one edit made for this reference: the local colour is declared highp instead of mediump. Not a dEQP case.
